<rml><head><link type="text/rcss" href="Lab.rcss" /></head><body><div id="lab"><p class="eyebrow">FORGE / UI MATERIALS</p><h1>One Shader. Two Materials.</h1><p>The same image uses a still band on the left and a moving, flipped band on the right.</p><div class="comparison"><div class="card"><h2>Still</h2><div class="clip"><div id="still" style='decorator:shader("material:fc9f4ed2-3bc5-48db-a10f-dc743f9d7984");' /></div><p>Speed 0 / normal UVs</p></div><div class="card"><h2>Motion</h2><div class="clip"><div id="motion" style='decorator:shader("material:b036298c-4a29-4e09-805d-78ee65fee4eb");' /></div><p>Speed 0.25 / flipped UVs / opacity 75%</p></div></div><p>Stop Play. Open Still.material.json or Motion.material.json in Content. Change Motion speed, Tint or image UVs, Save, then restart Play.</p><p>Presentation time continues while simulation is paused. No C++ module is required.</p></div></body></rml>
